             dict(hour=12, text="Salt is measured out by the modius under the eye of the king's man, later the censors' contractor; a load goes up the valley toward Reate. Flies on the mule-dung."),
             dict(hour=18, text="The last buyers gone; the salt stacked under hides against the dew. Shepherds light a fire on the shore and sing; the river turns bronze under the Janiculum."),
